      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To emphasize their different origins, focus on deep, rich tones in their complexions, such as rich ebony, burnished copper, or deep, earthy ochre tones from constant exposure to equatorial sunlight. Their physical build could be lean and powerful, suggesting endurance forged by rough terrain rather than refined training. Instead of monstrous traits, detail unique cultural markers like intricate scarification or elaborate tattooing that marks their societal roles, grounding their difference in belief rather than biology.",
