      "content": "Their temperament would likely be characterized by explosive fervor rather than measured discourse; when angered, their response would be immediate, visceral, and all-consuming, prioritizing foundational needs over abstract concepts. Socially, their bonds would be intensely tribal and highly localized, valuing unbreakable oaths and immediate kinship above any concept of impersonal law or written decree. In conflict, they would employ swift, brutal efficiency and tactical ruthlessness, viewing victory as a primal necessity rather than a political agreement.",
